# Spring Boot configuration (application*.properties) IS committed: the project cannot start without it.
# It holds no secrets - passwords and JWT keys come from environment variables (DB_PASSWORD, JWT_PRIVATE_KEY).
# Keep real secrets in .env or http-client.private.env.json, which stay ignored.
http-client.env.json
http-client.private.env.json
